  "description": "*** EMAILS ONLY FOR THIS PROPERTY PLEASE ***\n\nLiam Reilly Auctioneers are delighted to introduce this beautifully presented detached home at Garadice, Kilcock, Co. Meath to the rental market.\n\nSet on approximately 1 acre of beautifully maintained gardens, this attractive three-bedroom property offers spacious and comfortable accommodation in a peaceful countryside setting.\n\nThe accommodation comprises three bedrooms, kitchen, living room, sitting room, two bathrooms and garage. Presented in excellent condition throughout, the property offers an ideal opportunity for those seeking a comfortable home while enjoying the benefits of country living.\n\nThe property is conveniently situated in the countryside at Garadice, approximately 7.8 km from Kilcock (circa 11 minutes by car via the R158). Kilcock offers an excellent range of amenities including shops, pubs, cafés, schools and leisure facilities, together with excellent transport connections, including Kilcock Train Station and convenient access to the surrounding road network.\n\nThis property would ideally suit tenants with access to a car due to its countryside location.",
